IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lid-dates`
IMPORT `lid-core`

-- Legal Identity of Defendants (Organisational Child Abuse) Act 2018 (Vic) -- the seat of the survivor: a person who
-- was abused as a child and is looking for an organisational defendant to sue, where the organisation is an
-- unincorporated association (a church, club or other body with no legal personality of its own) that uses a trust.
-- Each question is asked as that person would ask it, with plain inputs; the rules are in lid-core.l4 and none is
-- restated here. Judgments for the court are asked as "would a court find ...", never decided.
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from plain-text conversions by Legalese Commons of Word files saved by hand, not the
